          %title Contents
          %blockquote
            %p
              This entry is about
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+vectors"} tangent vectors
              on
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differentiable+manifolds"} differentiable manifolds
              and the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle"} bundle
              they form. For
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangents"} tangents
              and the
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+function"} tangent function
              see there.
