                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi γ
                      %mrow
                        %msub
                          %mi v
                          %mi x
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mn 1
                    %mo →
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \gamma_{v_x} \colon \mathbb{R}^1 \to X
              is a smooth curve which represents the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+vector"} tangent vector
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi v
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi x
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
